":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later vertices in ascending index. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating again gives the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d) bitset words per clique for degeneracy d."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques","title":"AllCliques"}}}